### name followed by a nested expansion
slot=2
echo "${server$slot}"
>>> SC2082 2:7
>>> SC2154 2:7

### dollar-hash nested as the name
echo "${$#}"
>>> SC2082 1:7

### name with nested braced and arithmetic expansions
n=1
echo "${cfg${n}_$((n + 1))}"
>>> SC2082 2:7
>>> SC2154 2:7

### pattern substitution with an expansion is fine
needle=o
greeting="hello world"
echo "${greeting//$needle/0}"
>>> none
